      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضِبَارَةٌ</span></b>  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضُبَارَةٌ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِضْبَارَةٌ</span>, in four places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَبَائِرُ</span> is pl. of the former [or of each]: (Mgh,
